"Doubtful," Tyrath rumbles. "Your arrival coincides too cleanly with catastrophe. Regardless of your motives, whatever foresight you carry is an asset."

"What kind of information are you looking for?" I ask.

"I have drafted a strategy that represents our sole viable path to neutralizing Arraka permanently," Tyrath says. "I have coordinated with the High Council's battle mages since yesterday, after I warned them of her advance. Given that you hail from the future, confirm whether this maneuver was enacted in your past and whether it held. Nearby lies a mountain range we can use to--"

